Gree + brings you a brand new experience for intelligent control. As a new official application software that Gree  develops specially for IoT era, it has the functions of appliances management, intelligent control, etc., which makes your life much easier.  

Function introductions:
1、Intelligent products can be easily added into Gree ecosystem for intelligent management uniformly;
2、You can control the appliance at anytime and anywhere you like;
3、You can know the status of the appliance in real time and all changes of appliance status will be reported to you immediately。

The MP3 Converter app let you extract audio from your video in various formats with simple steps and save file to your phone. 

You can also: 
- Convert any video that you have in your gallery to MP3. 
- Mp3 cutter and edit song information
- Share mp3 with any social network, instant messaging app or email. 
- Supports specify start and end with any position;
- Supports custom bitrate, sample rate, volume;
- Supports audio track selection;
- Supports import video or audio from Camera Roll / Album / Dropbox / iCloud / Google Drive / One Drive;
- Supports "Open In..." or Share with other app;
- Supports application based integration. (Contact us).
